{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53842","headline":"赠敬睦助教 · 无可","name":"赠敬睦助教","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁掖人知连状荐，国庠官满一家贫。\n清仪都道蓬瀛客，直气堪爲谏诤臣。\n（见宋谢维新《古今合璧事类备要後集》卷四十、宋潘自牧《记纂渊海》卷三二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}